      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "错误衔接：装载 S100 后直接读 104，会漏掉三次变化。\n错误混合：先应用 A=11，再装入旧快照 A=10，会倒退。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
